#: ../doc/effects.rst:381
msgid "Mask Properties"
msgstr "Maska Eiginleikar"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:382
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mask: Source`, :guilabel:`Mask Mode`, :guilabel:`Mask: Time "
"Mode`, :guilabel:`Mask: Loop`, and :guilabel:`Mask: Invert` properties limit"
" where an effect is applied. The mask source can be a static image, image "
"sequence, video, :guilabel:`Tracker`, or :guilabel:`Object Detector`. Light "
"areas of the mask usually apply more of the effect, while dark areas apply "
"less; use :guilabel:`Mask: Invert` when you need the opposite result. "
"Tracker and Object Detector sources use their bounding boxes as the masked "
"region, which is useful for limiting effects such as blur, pixelation, color"
" correction, or sharpening to a specific subject."
msgstr ""
"Eiginleikar :guilabel:`Mask: Source`, :guilabel:`Mask Mode`, "
":guilabel:`Mask: Time Mode`, :guilabel:`Mask: Loop` og :guilabel:`Mask: "
"Invert` takmarka hvar áhrif eru beitt. Maskauppruni getur verið kyrrmynd, "
"myndaröð, myndband, :guilabel:`Tracker` eða :guilabel:`Object Detector`. "
"Ljós svæði maskans beita venjulega meira af áhrifunum, en dökk svæði minna; "
"notaðu :guilabel:`Mask: Invert` þegar þú þarft öfugan árangur. Uppruni "
"Tracker og Object Detector notar umgjörð þeirra sem maskað svæði, sem er "
"gagnlegt til að takmarka áhrif eins og óskýrleika, pixlunar, litabreytinga "
"eða skerpu við ákveðið viðfangsefni."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:391
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Track` property is an integer indicating the layer on which "
"the effect is placed. Effects on higher tracks are rendered above those on "
"lower tracks."
msgstr ""
"Eiginleikinn :guilabel:`Track` er heiltala sem sýnir lagið sem áhrifin eru "
"staðsett á. Áhrif á efri rásum eru sýnd ofan á þeim á neðri rásum."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:399
msgid "Effect Parent"
msgstr "Foreldri áhrifa"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:400
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Parent` property of an effect sets the initial keyframe "
"values to a parent effect. For example, if many effects all point to the "
"same parent effect, they will inherit all their initial properties, such as "
"font size, font color, and background color for a ``Caption`` effect. In the"
" example of many ``Caption`` effects using the same Parent effect, it is an "
"efficient way to manage a large number of these effects."
msgstr ""
"Eiginleikinn :guilabel:`Parent` áhrifa stillir upphafsgildi lykilramma til "
"foreldraáhrifa. Til dæmis, ef mörg áhrif vísa öll á sama foreldraáhrif, erfa"
" þau öll upphaflegar stillingar eins og leturstærð, leturlit og bakgrunnslit"
" fyrir ``Caption`` áhrif. Í dæminu með mörg ``Caption`` áhrif sem nota sama "
"foreldraáhrif er þetta skilvirk leið til að stjórna miklu magni af þessum "
"áhrifum."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:404
msgid ""
"NOTE: The ``parent`` property for effects should be linked to the **same "
"type** of parent effect, otherwise their default initial values will not "
"match. Also see :ref:`clip_parent_ref`."
msgstr ""
"ATH: Eiginleikinn ``parent`` fyrir áhrif ætti að tengjast **sama tegund** "
"foreldraáhrifa, annars munu sjálfgefnu upphafsgildin ekki passa. Sjá einnig "
":ref:`clip_parent_ref`."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:409
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Position` property determines the effect's position on the "
"timeline in seconds, with 0.0 indicating the beginning."
msgstr ""
"Eiginleikinn :guilabel:`Position` ákvarðar stöðu áhrifa á tímalínu í "
"sekúndum, þar sem 0.0 táknar byrjun."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:415
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Start` property defines the trimming point at the beginning "
"of the effect in seconds. Changing this property will impact the "
":guilabel:`Duration` effect property."
msgstr ""
"Eiginleikinn :guilabel:`Start` skilgreinir skerðipunkt við byrjun áhrifa í "
"sekúndum. Breyting á þessum eiginleika hefur áhrif á :guilabel:`Duration` "
